(7780535, 1294380, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Nice capture with the bird in flight with both wings visible and the eye looking great.  Unique to see a fish in the mouth rather than the claws.  Harsh lighting at that time of day is tough.  Maybe also if you are photoshop/lightroom inclined select the sky and give it a touch more saturation to give the image some pop.</td>', 'Nice capture with the bird in flight with both wings visible and the eye looking great.  Unique to see a fish in the mouth rather than the claws.  Harsh lighting at that time of day is tough.  Maybe also if you are photoshop/lightroom inclined select the sky and give it a touch more saturation to give the image some pop.', '2025-05-07 06:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7780538, 1294295, 91496, '<td valign="top">
This effect is so cool.  Not sure if this was intentional or the product of 100''s of panning shots and then a happy accident.  Either way, well done.  The blue streaks are great as a background the bird is sharp in the sharp places.  The black parts of the bird is perhaps a bit dark.</td>', 'This effect is so cool.  Not sure if this was intentional or the product of 100''s of panning shots and then a happy accident.  Either way, well done.  The blue streaks are great as a background the bird is sharp in the sharp places.  The black parts of the bird is perhaps a bit dark.', '2025-05-07 06:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7780539, 1294274, 91496, '<td valign="top">
